5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to know if past projects actually served users well.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am worried about how construction disrupts the daily class timetable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Schedules slip constantly. I need to see where the delays actually come from.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Paper costs are fiction. I need to see what things actually cost.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Who is left to fix the mess? I need to see the staffing reality.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, cost is vital, but if users hate the result, it is wasted.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, agreed. But if the room is closed for months, usage drops to zero.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, exactly. Weather and logistics eat the calendar. I will check the diaries.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, true. But if the budget blows up, the project dies anyway.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, budget is fine. If no one is left to maintain it, it fails.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look at post-occupancy reviews to see what actually worked.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the timetable records to see how long rooms stay out of service.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the weather days and the delivery schedules to predict slippage.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the tender records and the renewal reserve for hidden costs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the staffing posts and the technicians' weekly routines.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let us see the data before we guess.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,The silence in the timetable is the loudest warning.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,A year of building squeezed into weeks is a disaster waiting to happen.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"If the numbers do not match the market, we are flying blind.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"If the staff are already drowning, adding more work is not an option.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
